  "answer": {
    "text": "Pipedrive and HubSpot Sales Hub work best for a 10-person B2B sales team, balancing ease of use, robust pipeline tracking, and scalability without enterprise-level complexity.\nTop CRM Options for a 10-Person Team\nPipedrive:: Ideal if your team needs a clean, visual sales pipeline that reps will actually update. It requires minimal setup, offers great activity-based selling features, and integrates smoothly with standard email and calendar tools.\nHubSpot Sales Hub:: Best if you run an inbound motion or plan to closely align sales with marketing. It offers powerful email tracking, templates, and seamless document sharing, though costs can scale up quickly as you add advanced automation.\nClose:: Perfect for outbound-heavy or phone-driven B2B teams. It includes built-in calling, SMS, and email sequencing features that eliminate the need for costly third-party dialer integrations.\nZoho CRM:: Great for teams needing advanced automation and custom modules on a tighter budget. It has a steeper learning curve than Pipedrive, but offers massive flexibility for the price.",
